{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1479884-money-in-scion-2e","id":1479884,"title":"Money in Scion 2E","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-05-01T04:07:42-07:00","id":1479884,"title":"Money in Scion 2E","content":"How money works in Scion 2E? I do not see any power, Edge, Knack or Merit pointing ro them. So I get it right that your Origin Path determines how wealthy character is? And 'Life of Privilege' Path basically mean character may bought ANYTHING? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-01T04:36:43-07:00","id":1479886,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1479884-money-in-scion-2e#post1479884\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How money works in Scion 2E? I do not see any power, Edge, Knack or Merit pointing ro them. So I get it right that your Origin Path determines how wealthy character is? And 'Life of Privilege' Path basically mean character may bought ANYTHING? \ud83e\udd14</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> No, only things that make sense to the paths. Honestly, it is not a big deal, one of the characters in the last game we played was literaly the Mayor of Chicago, with some sinister contacts with mafia and general evil guys, yet the game flow without any issue.<br /> <br /> Also, once you get some of the purviews, mundane money worth nothing, and thats when the real Scion play starts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-05-01T13:26:45-07:00","id":1479907,"title":"","content":"When figuring out how much a character can buy, it's pretty simple:<br /> <br /> 1) It makes complete sense they could get this because of their Paths, they have it and/or can get it as fast as it makes sense.<br /> <br /> 2) It would take some effort for them in some fashion but their Path can justify it (ex: even if you're fabulously rich, there's a difference between placing an order for a mega-yacht that will be finished in a few years, vs. trying to buy one in less than a month), and follow the rules for straining your relevant Path.<br /> <br /> 3) I doesn't make sense that one of your Paths would let you get something, so you have to figure out a way to get it in play (you know, like that whole Deed system is meant to get players to establish character/band goals so the SG knows to include those as plot points).<br /> <br /> One of the reasons Scion 2e doesn't care about wealth like Trinity does, is because as Mateus notes, you progress past the point of material wealth being a serious impediment to you very quickly in Scion.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-29T21:14:02-07:00","id":1491866,"title":"","content":"Mechanical multiplier of narrative success. When a giant successfully hits, the multiplier increases by 2.<br /> Dramatic scale is the effect of Scale on the characters and the scene in a roleplaying context, granting additional Enhancements against pivotal people and objects. The same giant, under the command of another, is being briefed on the frailties of the various characters. <div align=\"right\"><a href=\"https://dinosaur-game.io\" target=\"_blank\">Dinosaur Game</a></div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27572,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27572-nathanfowler","user":"NathanFowler","date":". 12-24-2024, 01:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27572-nathanfowler","name":"NathanFowler","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}